NoETL VQCC portfolio package

This package contains quantum circuits written by other people and published
on Kaggle under the Apache License 2.0 (some parts CC0). They are
redistributed unmodified, except where a file is marked "polish-" in
CREDITS.md, which means the NoETL rewrite pass (noetl/quantum, Apache-2.0)
changed it.

Authors and per-file credit chains: see CREDITS.md.
License text: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

This package counts for leaderboard ranking only. It is not an original
NoETL result and is not eligible for prizes.
